{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream Eater is a turn-based RPG about overcoming a dreamless land. Meet allies, journey through different regions, manage your hunger, slay foes, become stronger, dream again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team oriented turn-based combat: Battle with up to 3 active party members. Each party member learns their own skills and abilities as they level up. Using skills costs &quot;thought points&quot;, a resource generated at the start of each round. Skills also reduce the party's hunger. The lower your hunger level gets, the harsher impact it will have on your party members during combat, while keeping a high hunger level makes your party members stronger!\u00a0To be successful you must manage your hunger while defeating your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/5485064ce15efd0cfad440233702a125.poster.avif?t=1767833033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/5485064ce15efd0cfad440233702a125.webm?t=1767833033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/5485064ce15efd0cfad440233702a125.mp4?t=1767833033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your hunger: Keep your party's hunger levels high or suffer penalties during battle. Most actions in the game, including simply exploring areas, collecting resources, and using skills during combat will affect the hunger level of the party. You must manage your hunger well if you hope to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/e0836eb44162a694eec5bcf7a6dd99db.poster.avif?t=1767833033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/e0836eb44162a694eec5bcf7a6dd99db.webm?t=1767833033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/e0836eb44162a694eec5bcf7a6dd99db.mp4?t=1767833033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your relationship with your party members: As you continue your adventure, you will come across unfamiliar faces, some of who might even join you on your journey. Talking with party members can affect their relationship level with you. Who knows what secrets they might be hiding...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/820fe13375e834fa4f6aa37954f2ae76.poster.avif?t=1767833033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/820fe13375e834fa4f6aa37954f2ae76.webm?t=1767833033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/820fe13375e834fa4f6aa37954f2ae76.mp4?t=1767833033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Items: Collect a variety of resources and recipes which will help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/11515adc582a0f7edb6899da8fc58554.poster.avif?t=1767833033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/11515adc582a0f7edb6899da8fc58554.webm?t=1767833033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/11515adc582a0f7edb6899da8fc58554.mp4?t=1767833033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore: Be sure to check each region carefully, you never know what you may find. Be careful though, not everything you find will like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/041030343414c66c8a842a677d4a1598.poster.avif?t=1767833033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/041030343414c66c8a842a677d4a1598.webm?t=1767833033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/extras/041030343414c66c8a842a677d4a1598.mp4?t=1767833033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices Matter: Certain actions and dialogue choices you make will affect your playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer Dangerous Dungeons: While adventuring you may find dungeons. These often contain powerful and sometimes necessary rewards. Dungeons are much more dangerous than exploring the general region they are found in, and likely do not contain any resources. Make sure you are prepared before entering!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D Art Style: The game blends 3D environments and lighting with a classic pixel art look.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055060?t=1767833033","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055060?t=1767833033","capsule_image":"https