nd in, and likely do not contain any resources. Make sure you are prepared before entering!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D Art Style: The game blends 3D environments and lighting with a classic pixel art look.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Knight Vision Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/5ac58a9f8412c04a5cd0830c684928a23ee5b717/header.jpg?t=1767833033","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Dream Eater","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128mb<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Knight Vision Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q4 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/17478e5a2f1c8c5b0c7f8464314fd51926a50311/ss_17478e5a2f1c8c5b0c7f8464314fd51926a50311.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767833033","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/17478e5a2f1c8c5b0c7f8464314fd51926a50311/ss_17478e5a2f1c8c5b0c7f8464314fd51926a50311.600x338.jpg?t=1767833033"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055060/fefeded4a7d543483b41362ae4a08fb7dbb320ac/ss_fefeded4a7d543483b41362ae4